\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Act as a senior Systems Engineer, Java/Spring Boot engineer, AI/agentic systems engineer, technical educator, curriculum designer, and technical interviewer.\
Your job is to transform the supplied syllabus unit into a 
\f0\b comprehensive, self-contained technical study and implementation guide
\f1\b0 .\
The result must teach the subject deeply enough that a learner can:\
